            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye ŋata nyalo tiyo ri rwodhe ario; go bino maro acel to dak man, kosa nyalo tiyo ri acel to cayo man. Ikinyal tiyo ri Were kodi ri lim bende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo awaco riwin gime: Wikiri wirembi kwoŋ gir'acama kodi gir'amadha ma wiyenyo ma kwo, kosa ruk ri delkwoŋ win. Adieri kwo pa dhano kiloy cemo, odoko delkwoŋe kiloy ruk? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni win winyin ma jouco malo, jokipidhi kodhi, jokicoki cemo jokethi i dere, to kole Bawin manitie i polo kuro jo! To kere win wikiloy winyin no bor? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋa kwoŋ win manyalo medo kiyindira i kwo pere ro rembo ri gigipiny no?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To raŋo ma wirembo ri ruk? Neni win thiw dudi paka jodongo; jokicwer kwok i tic odoko wegi jokitim ruk pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.4+1KI.10.5+1KI.10.6+1KI.10.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kerin 10:4-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.3+2CH.9.4+2CH.9.5+2CH.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kigana 9:3-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To awaco riwin kada Solomon, ma cango oŋaŋ m'oasere, k'obedo gi ruk mabeyo paka nyaka acel kwoŋ thiw dudi me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To k'inen meno apaka Were ruko lum, ma konon nitie to yawere mere thwo t'iwaŋo i kendo, go k'oruki win maloyo kenyo, a ji ma yeyo pajo nok me! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo wikiri wicaki rembo, ka wiwaco ni, “Wanocam aŋo?” Kosa ni, “Wanomadhi aŋo?” Kosa ni, “Wanoruki aŋo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole me a gigipiny ma jokafir joyenyo hongo je; aka Bawin manitie i polo oŋeyo nike wiyenyo gi go je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kutho rangi win Ker pa Were kodi tiro ma go yenyo, aka go bino miyo win gigipiny me je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo wikiri wirembi ri gima dikin; kole kisi ndelo won yawere gi wac mere. Ki yenyere medo teko man wi teko ma piny m'oyawere kelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
